# attached_assets/ is ~240 MB of source art, drafts and pasted files, of which
# the build imports a few dozen (`@assets/…` in client/src). The rest stays out
# of the build context. A new `@assets/` import needs its line here or the image
# build can't resolve it: client/src/test/dockerignore.test.ts checks the two agree.
